GUI OPTIONAL ACTIVECHECK OSM_IN_OUTPUT_INCOMPLETE_WAYS_AND_RELATIONS_OSM_2 yes,OSM_IN_USE_SEARCH_ENVELOPE_OSM_2,++OSM_IN_USE_SEARCH_ENVELOPE_OSM_2+No%no Output Incomplete Ways and Relations:
